# monomind runtime — local state this repo never tracks. Listing individual
# paths meant every new directory monomind started writing (neural/, system/,
# dashboard-token-<port>, …) showed up as untracked noise until someone added
# a line for it. Nothing under .monomind/ is tracked here, so ignore the lot.
.monomind/

